# WalletConnect Cloud project ID, free at https://cloud.walletconnect.com.
# Optional: without it the widget still loads MetaMask / Rabby / Coinbase
# Wallet connectors. Setting it adds the WalletConnect v2 connector so
# mobile wallets (Rainbow, Trust, etc.) can pair via QR.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and paste your ID below.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=
